%N A399621 Triangle T(n,k), 1 <= k <= n, read by rows: minimum number of monochromatic axis-parallel rectangles in a 2-coloring of a k X n grid.
%C A399621 T(n,k) is the minimum, over all 2-colorings of a k X n grid, of the number of rectangles whose four corners have the same color. The selected rows and columns need not be consecutive.
%e A399621 The rows shown, for n=1..8, are:
